      "dependsOn": [
        "item/api-content"
      ],
      "doneWhen": "End-to-end url then commit; a size or checksum mismatch is rejected and the staging object removed; an archived period is rejected at upload-url; the sweep removes only stale staging objects. The per-file versions commit appends through a StoreFileVersion entry point taking the File itself, which cannot create one (issue #115): the API commit step has no Directory and no client filename, so it cannot use handle() without the string-passing hazard that issue describes. Browser::replaceFile() moves onto the same entry point. handle()'s create-or-append behaviour and StoreFileVersionTest are unchanged, and the container smoke's replace mutation (PR #118) still fails against an image whose Replace calls handle() with the client filename.",
